  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Arab Partnership Economic Facility (APEF) - European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD) Trust Fund Contributions in Middle East and North Africa (MENA).</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Arab Partnership Economic Facility (APEF) - European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD) Trust Fund Contributions in Middle East and North Africa (MENA). is a component of Arab Partnership Economic Facility (APEF) - European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD) Cooperation Fund in Middle East and North Africa (MENA). reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;5,000,000. This project benefits Middle East, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Business policy and administration, Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development, Sectors not specified, Agricultural development, Energy generation, renewable sources - multiple technologies, Environmental policy and administrative management, Public sector policy and administrative management, Transport policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
